mori::syntax::unclosed_agreement

  × The agreement `Invoice` never closes.
   ╭─[test.mori:3:20]
 1 │ profile "moriarty-beta/1";
 2 │ agreement Invoice {
   ·           ───┬───
   ·              ╰── the agreement starts here
 3 │   const price = 10;
   ·                    ▲
   ·                    ╰── the file ends here
   ╰────
  help: Add a `}` after the last declaration or action:

            agreement Invoice {
              ...
            }
